      en: ["Built: 1372", "Hill height: 27 m (89 ft)", "Legendary founder: Daun Penh", "Gives name to Phnom Penh („Hill of Penh”)", "Major renovation: 1894", "Main Buddha statue: bronze, 2 m tall"],
