      ro: ["An construcție: sfârșitul secolului al XII-lea", "Arhitect: Jayavarman VII", "Diametrul bazinului central: 20 m", "Număr bazine: 5", "Stil: Bayon", "Material: gresie"],
      en: ["Construction period: late 12th century", "Builder: King Jayavarman VII", "Central basin diameter: 20 m", "Number of animal spouts: 4", "UNESCO designation: 1992", "Restoration by World Monuments Fund: 2000s"],
