      hu: ["A balusztrád hozzávetőlegesen 25 méter hosszú", "A 12. században épült", "Minden Naga fej 5-9 kígyófejből áll", "Anyaga homokkő", "A Spean Praptos híd 85 méter hosszú", "A balusztrádot a 20. században részben restaurálták"],
      ro: ["Balustrada are aproximativ 25 de metri lungime", "Datează din secolul al XII-lea", "Fiecare Naga are între 5 și 9 capete", "Materialul este gresie", "Podul Spean Praptos are 85 de metri lungime", "Balustrada a fost parțial restaurată în secolul al XX-lea"],
      en: ["The balustrade is approximately 25 meters long", "It dates from the 12th century", "Each Naga has 5 to 9 heads", "The material is sandstone", "Spean Praptos bridge is 85 meters long", "The balustrade was partially restored in the 20th century"],
